{"scenario": "graph/put-parsed-round-trip", "requires": ["v1", "fake-backend"], "doc": "A scan's plan through graph/put-parsed (Urdr Task 15a): the plan, its task and step stored as parsed entities with their parent links and file time, read back through the Lisp readers' node, edge and file views; the same scan again writes nothing; a derived status is one new version; the file gone retires all it held."}
